<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('layout-partials/head', { title: 'How it works' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('layout-partials/page-bg', { hideEmojiField: true }) %>

  <div class="container">
    <%- include('layout-partials/nav') %>

    <section class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h1>An idea to an answer, in four.</h1>
      <p>No account, no app to install for either of you. Just a link that plays a game and asks a question.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="lp-section" data-reveal>
      <div class="lp-cards lp-cards--four">
        <div class="lp-card lp-card--accent">
          <span class="lp-card__label">01</span>
          <span class="lp-card__icon">🎮</span>
          <h3 class="lp-card__headline">Pick a game</h3>
          <p>Choose from the bank, or ask for something custom built.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card lp-card--ink">
          <span class="lp-card__label">02</span>
          <span class="lp-card__icon">💬</span>
          <h3 class="lp-card__headline">Write your question</h3>
          <p>Happy birthday, will you marry me, did you get the job. Anything you actually want to know.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card lp-card--cream">
          <span class="lp-card__label">03</span>
          <span class="lp-card__icon">🔗</span>
          <h3 class="lp-card__headline">Share the link</h3>
          <p>Send it to whoever you want to ask, or let them scan the QR. It stays live for a month.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-card lp-card--accent">
          <span class="lp-card__label">04</span>
          <span class="lp-card__icon">💌</span>
          <h3 class="lp-card__headline">Get the answer</h3>
          <p>The moment they play it and answer, it lands in your inbox.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lp-section" id="ideas" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="lp-section__title">Not sure what to ask? Steal one.</h2>
      <div class="idea-chips" data-reveal-stagger>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Pizza or sushi tonight?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Where should we go this weekend?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">What should we name the puppy?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Beach or mountains for the trip?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">What's for your birthday dinner?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Should we finally get that tattoo?</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lp-final" data-reveal>
      <h2>Got your question? Let's go.</h2>
      <div class="lp-hero__actions">
        <a href="/games" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Browse games</a>
        <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Try a demo first</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('layout-partials/footer') %>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/reveal.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/games/shared.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/emoji-field.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
